  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup chopped walnuts",
    "1 (15.25 ounce) package yellow cake mix",
    "4 large eggs",
    "0.5 cup dark rum",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 (3.5 ounce) package instant vanilla pudding mix",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.125 cup water",
    "0.25 cup rum"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease and flour a 10-inch Bundt or tube pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YafmK-UtOFSBNJ7rSrznAUGVTNQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-01-c654dcafd81a415192e1987cdaf17ec1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cake: Sprinkle walnuts over the bottom of the prepared pan; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AzIiRUSlP2hUF17dx9Derx1-JyQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-02-2da367b5818845cc87a0429da8a1e732.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cake mix, eggs, dark rum, water, oil, and vanilla pudding mix together in a large bowl until well combined. Pour batter over walnuts in the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H0e8If36DBpA0CC_axMlYBiB3c8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-03-d8f10abd7bb648c2a9da596697ab02df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L0rvWDwUwKtVaFeIFPXtlMh85mE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-04-1toothpickinframe-14aa3f2cb60849e78533c43b4cf336cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool, then invert cake onto a serving plate. Gently prick holes into the top and sides of cake with a toothpick or skewer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fQHuoyrSa1h2jAMlJvMjq_Y18Go=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-05-poke-ef7c70df27544265aa7cc7c03bb4eeed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the glaze: Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Stir sugar and water into melted butter; bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/efOEYinusvEAp5zAPm5S8P5_SEA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-06-484e5156d3da4787b75fda28bb1f4fb5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook, stirring constantly, for 5 minutes. Remove glaze from heat; stir in rum.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2cnmmt_DC4MxMxtqNpRm-18JBmM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-07-2rumaddedhandinframe-971caf3fece9475c9c4e121b589c8a5c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle warm glaze over top and sides of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9GYyxdxT49qI4O6oMD1Bo7-_jYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7364-easy-rum-cake-VAT-step-08-238ab70055f34bec9034c0a69ce8b276.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7364/step_08.webp"
    }
